+/* 🦍 GORILLA UNLEASHED - THE MASTER PREFERENCES THEME */
+/* :root background override removed - using native design system */
+/* Removed aggressive background overrides that broke selection highlights *//* LINK SIDEBAR ICONS: Replace tiny monochrome SVGs with high-res colored Gorilla */
+.category-icon {
+  content: url("chrome://branding/content/about-logo.png") !important;
+  width: 42px !important; /* Scaled up from 32px */
+  height: 42px !important;
+  -moz-context-properties: none !important;
+  filter: none !important;
+  margin-inline-end: 12px !important;
+}
+
+/* ==========================================================================
+   GORILLA REJECTED 2026-08-01: privacy-pane promo gorilla injection
+   (moz-promo img content-replacement + moz-promo container styling)
+   REMOVED by author verdict -- the pane is too text-dense for art. This
